    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0165" n="157" xml:id="pg157"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/1411: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Representative of the President</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Corrigan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-03-28T13:00:00-05:00">March 28, 1939—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 3:22 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>30. I have informed Ocheltree of the contents of the Department’s telegram No.
                    23, March 25, midnight [<hi rendition="#italic">noon</hi>], and asked him to
                    sound out Licenciado Zúñiga Montúfar regarding an early visit with me to
                    Tegucigalpa.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Corrigan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
